Package: openmediavault-example
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0)
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault Example plugin (template skeleton)
 Template plugin for OpenMediaVault 8.x demonstrating the full
 standard plugin structure: datamodel + confdb + engined RPC +
 engine module + Salt state (systemd service mode and Docker
 Compose stack mode) + declarative Workbench pages + zh_CN/zh_TW
 translations + GitHub Actions packaging. Copy the repository,
 replace 'example' with the target service name and trim the
 integration mode that is not needed.
